// P3G.5 ex-dv4 (derived-and-linking.md ex-dv4, DV2.2, DV2.3, DV1.4; the gap file's Risks): an
// assembly in document C inserts A's block at V1, mates it, then updates to V2: the mate
// survives because its face persists; a later version that loses the face makes the mate an
// error. Stand-ins: A (`fixtures/linked_block_standin.cadrs`, V1, folder "Linked parts") and C
// "Block assembly" (`fixtures/linked_base_standin.cadrs`: the Part Studio "Base", a
// 100 × 100 × 10 plate, and "Assembly 1" with Base <1> fixed).
// 01 C's Assembly 1: Base <1> (fixed).
// 02 Insert → Other documents → Linked parts → Block source at V1: "Part 1" follows the pointer.
// 03 placed and ✓: "Part 1 <1>" with the link icon.
// 04 Fastened 1 (`linked-ex dv4-mate`: the block's bottom-face centre on the plate's top-face
//    centre), its dialog opened from the Mate Features list: the two connectors.
// 05 all instances, Mass properties: 100·100·10 + 37 500 = 137 500 mm³, centroid
//    (50, 50, 9.773) (= (100 000·5 + 37 500·22.5)/137 500).
// 06 A edited (Extrude 1 25 → 40) and V2 made in its own document (as ex-dv2), back in C: the
//    blue badge on Part 1 <1> and on the tab.
// 07 the badge clicked: the Reference manager, "V1 ⇒ V2", Update all.
// 08 updated: the block 40 high still on the plate (Fastened 1 resolves the same bottom face by
//    its name, no error): 160 000 mm³, centroid (50, 50, 14.375) (= (500 000 + 60 000·30)/160 000).
// 09 A's Sketch 1 redrawn (every face renamed) and V3 (`linked-ex dv4-redraw`); Update all:
//    Fastened 1 is red, its tooltip "Missing reference: the entity this mate was on is gone from
//    Part 1 <1> …": the lost face is an error, not a silent old position.
// 10 Ctrl+Z: back to V2, Fastened 1 healthy again.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(20),
        Custom("linked-fixture store linked_block_standin folder"),
        Wait(5),
        Custom("linked-fixture open linked_base_standin Assembly 1"),
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(60),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-c-assembly"),
        Click(ui("insert")),
        WaitFor("insert-dialog"),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("insert-source-1")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-loc-mine"),
        Wait(5),
        WaitFor("insert-other-loc-folder-linked-parts"),
        Click(ui("insert-other-loc-folder-linked-parts")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-doc-block-source"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("insert-other-doc-block-source")),
        WaitFor("insert-other-header"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("insert-part-part-1")),
        Wait(3),
        Hover(world(150, 60)),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("02-insert-block-v1"),
        Click(world(150, 60)),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("insert-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(10),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-inserted-linked"),
        Custom("linked-ex dv4-mate"),
        Wait(60),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        DoubleClick(ui("mate-row-1")),
        WaitFor("mate-dialog-accept"),
        Wait(20),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-fastened-1-dialog"),
        Key("Escape"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("instance-root")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "137500.000"),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "9.773"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-v1-mass"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Wait(5),
        Key("Space"),
        Wait(3),
        Custom("move-doc open Block source"),
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(60),
        DoubleClick(ui("feature-extrude-1")),
        WaitFor("extrude-dialog-title"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("extrude-depth-field")),
        Wait(2),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("40"),
        Key("Tab"),
        Wait(20),
        Click(ui("extrude-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(40),
        Click(ui("document-create-version")),
        WaitFor("create-version-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        Click(ui("create-version-create")),
        Wait(30),
        Custom("move-doc open Block assembly"),
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Wait(90),
        Click(ui("tab-assembly-1")),
        Wait(40),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        Hover(ui("instance-row-2-linked")),
        Wait(50),
        Screenshot("06-badge"),
        Click(ui("instance-row-2-linked")),
        WaitFor("reference-manager"),
        Wait(15),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("07-reference-manager"),
        Click(ui("refman-update")),
        Wait(90),
        Key("F"),
        Wait(30),
        Click(ui("instance-root")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("view-mass")),
        WaitFor("mass-dialog"),
        Wait(10),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "160000.000"),
        ExpectText("mass-dialog", "14.375"),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("08-v2-mate-survives"),
        Click(ui("mass-dialog-cancel")),
        Wait(5),
        Key("Space"),
        Wait(3),
        Custom("linked-ex dv4-redraw"),
        Wait(60),
        Click(ui("instance-row-2-linked")),
        WaitFor("reference-manager"),
        Wait(15),
        Click(ui("refman-update")),
        Wait(90),
        Hover(ui("mate-row-1")),
        Wait(50),
        Screenshot("09-lost-face-mate-error"),
        Key("Ctrl+Z"),
        Wait(90),
        MoveTo(1420, 780),
        Wait(40),
        Screenshot("10-undo-v2-healthy"),
    ],
)
